IGPolarisVideoMedia","pk":"3981505838556447980","__isXIGPolarisMedia":"XIGPolarisVideoMedia","accessibility_caption":"Video by Housiey OnSite on September 08, 2026. May be an image of \u200etext that says \"\u200e\uc8fc HOUSIEY HOME HOME HOMEBUYINGSIMPLIFED BUYING UYINGSIMPI SIMPLIFIED Metro Saraswati Square MetroGroup Metro Group LTLTENDING SRLRISEE \u064a PLMENCE \u1218\u1208\u1263\u1230\u1235 D[W] Cal:+91 930 DtWICaR+919930000058 930.00 058 930000058 \u1042\u1005\u1038\u200e\"\u200e.","caption":{"text":"Metro Saraswati Square Mulund West | Luxurious 1 BHK, 2 BHK & 3 BHK Flats In Mumbai\n\nMetro Saraswati Square \u2013 Premium 1, 2 & 3 BHK Residences in Mulund West, Mumbai By Metro Group\n\nPrime Location \u2013 Behind Mulund College of Commerce, JSD Road, Ashok Nagar, Mulund West, Mumbai\nMulund Railway Station \u2013 450 m\nHira Mongi Navneet Hospital \u2013 1.4 km\nR Mall \u2013 1.8 km\n\nUSP\nExperience a prime location with lifetime open views, private decks, and the convenience of podium surface parking.\n\nProject Overview\nSpread across 1 Acre of Land Parcel\n1 Premium Tower\nStructure: Ground + 3 Cores + 11 Podiums + 39 Floors\nPremium 1, 2 & 3 BHK Residences\n\nConfigurations & Carpet Area\n1 BHK \u2013 451 sq.ft.\n2 BHK \u2013 648 sq.ft.\n3 BHK \u2013 823 sq.ft.\n\n10+ Luxurious Amenities\nSwimming Pool\nGymnasium\nMultipurpose Hall\nIndoor Games\nChildren's Play Area\nAnd Many More\n\nPossession Status\nRERA Possession: December 2027\n\n Explore Now : https:\/\/housiey.com\/projects\/metro-saraswati-square\n\n#metrosaraswatisquare #metrogroup #mulundwest #mulund #ashoknagar #mumbairealestate #mumbaihomes #1bhk #2bhk #3bhk #newlaunchmumbai #mumbaiproperty #mumbailife #housiey"},"code":"DdBJncaTQTs","seo_canonical_url":null,"display_uri":"https:\/\/scontent-bom5-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/799525588_18089940068445356_6865549322682595798_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ\u00253D\u00253D&_nc_ohc=6Bjban3kF4kQ7kNvwF7ky1e&_nc_oc=AdqGnJJK9Q26pP2TmF-BGBq-1KVN5Nu4w8ROgYLDvxSN5dUJWtYbNguyYEz64gGSmJM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-bom5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=y4Vzkqxj3TDNPNZGCp-2AQ&_nc_ss=7b689&oh=00_AQJXu3TMPYIGAKnq-fcctsPmI6wf98P4LjCISYqPyO8eAQ&oe=6AA5B8F2","media_type":2,"product_type":"clips","user":{"pk":"43220429355","username":"housieyonsite","id":"17841443360652553"},"id":"POLARIS_3981505838556447980"}},{"node":{"__typename":"XIGPolarisVideoMedia","pk":"3981477239686296760","__isXIGPolarisMedia":"XIGPolarisVideoMedia","accessibility_caption":"Video by Housiey OnSite on September 07, 2026. May be an image of text that says \"\uc870 HOUSIEY F HOME HOMEBUYINGSIMPLIFIED BUYING OMEBUYING SIMPLIFIED haria\".","caption":{"text":"Rohan Harita Tathawade | Premium 2 BHK To 4 BHK Flats In Pune\n\nRohan Harita \u2013 Premium 2, 3, 3.5 & 4 BHK Residences in Tathawade, Pune By Rohan Builders\n\nPrime Location \u2013 Ashok Nagar Road, Ashok Nagar, Tathawade, Pune\nAundh-Ravet BRTS Road \u2013 850 m\nBhumkar Chowk \u2013 2.4 km\n\nUSP\nThoughtfully designed homes surrounded by greenery, offering a peaceful and refreshing lifestyle in Tathawade.\n\nProject Overview\nSpread across 8.5 Acres of Land Parcel\n9 Premium Towers\nStructure: 2 Basements + Ground + 4 Podiums + 32\/26\/19 Floors\nPremium 2, 3, 3.5 & 4 BHK Residences\n\nConfigurations & Carpet Area\n2 BHK \u2013 715 & 736 sq.ft.\n3 BHK \u2013 942 & 1098 sq.ft.\n3.5 BHK \u2013 1377 sq.ft.\n4 BHK \u2013 1740 sq.ft.\n\n40+ Luxurious Amenities\nGymnasium\nIndoor Games\nClubhouse\nSwimming Pool\nAnd Many More\n\nPossession Status\nRERA Possession: December 2028\n\n Explore Now : https:\/\/housiey.com\/projects\/rohan-harita\n\n#rohanharita #rohanbuilders #tathawade #tathawadepune #punerealestate #punehomes #2bhk #3bhk #3.5bhk #4bhk #4point5bhk #punereels #housiey"},"code":"DdBDHRozfS4","seo_canonical_url":null,"display_uri":"https:\/\/scontent-bom5-2.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-1