to Mundhwa Road\nKopa Mall \u2013 2 km\nMundhwa Chowk \u2013 2.3 km\n\nUSP \u2013\nExperience Luxury | Resort-Style Living | Premium Locality of Pune\nPresenting Godrej Skyline by Godrej Properties, a premium residential project designed to offer a luxurious, resort-style living experience in one of Pune's most sought-after localities. With spacious residences, premium surroundings, and 50+ luxurious amenities, the project is thoughtfully crafted for elevated family living.\n\nProject Overview\nSpread across 3.75 Acres of Land Parcel\n4 Premium Towers\nStructure: Basement + Ground + UG + 5 Podiums + 29 Floors\nPremium 3 & 4.5 BHK Residences\n\nConfigurations & Carpet Area:\n3 BHK \u2013 1,360 sq.ft.\n4.5 BHK \u2013 2,500 sq.ft.\n\n50+ Luxurious Lifestyle Amenities Include:\nSwimming Pool\nSenior Citizen Area\nMultipurpose Area\nKids Play Area\nAnd Many More\n\nPossession Timeline:\nRERA Possession \u2013 June 2029\n\n\ud83c\udf10 Explore Now: https:\/\/housiey.com\/projects\/godrej-skyline \n \n\n. \n.\n#godrejskyline #godrejproperties #koregaonpark #koregaonparkpune #pune #punerealestate #punehomes #3bhkpune #4_5bhkpune #luxuryflats #luxuryhomes #premiumhomes #punerealestate #dreamhome #shorts #housiey"},"code":"Dc8f9VYTovD","seo_canonical_url":null,"display_uri":"https:\/\/scontent-bom5-2.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/796687948_18089691689445356_3207668653632029103_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ\u00253D\u00253D&_nc_ohc=Kf9xNSkxB-UQ7kNvwHXV6se&_nc_oc=AdrfetQTGNkvBt_a4FMyUQCQPo6eLDnUX3yovjc3KP7P2pbhty0wuMFO8EHwjZOZKeQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-bom5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=y4Vzkqxj3TDNPNZGCp-2AQ&_nc_ss=7b689&oh=00_AQLEq8YR1rYAUQyPgG4jRJ50qHZOoxjnc3XsziHb0zGiYw&oe=6AA5C0C2","media_type":2,"product_type":"clips","user":{"pk":"43220429355","username":"housieyonsite","id":"17841443360652553"},"id":"POLARIS_3980196724974980035"}},{"node":{"__typename":"XIGPolarisVideoMedia","pk":"3979513528545254559","__isXIGPolarisMedia":"XIGPolarisVideoMedia","accessibility_caption":"Video by Housiey OnSite on September 05, 2026. May be an image of overskirt and text that says \"\u8c37 HOUSIEY HOME HOMEGUYINGSIMPLIFIED HOMEBUYINGSI BUYING SIMPLIFIED ADANI ATELIER GREEN\".","caption":{"text":"Adani Atelier Greens Koregaon Park | Luxurious 2 BHK To 4.5 BHK Flats In Mundhwa Pune\n\nAdani Atier Greens \u2013 Premium 2, 2.5, 3 & 4.5 BHK Residences in Mundhwa, Pune By Adani Realty\n\nPrime Location \u2013 Near Koregaon Park, Mundhwa, Pune\nMundhwa Road \u2013 Direct connectivity to Ghorpadi Road\nKOPA Mall \u2013 2.3 km\nMundhwa Chowk \u2013 2.5 km\n\nUSP\nWant to live in a premium locality in Pune with 40+ luxurious amenities and excellent connectivity to malls and major IT hubs? Adani Atier Greens brings premium living and urban convenience together in one address.\n\nProject Overview\nSpread across 3.5 Acres of Land Parcel\n7 Premium Towers\nStructure: 2 Basements + Ground + 15 Floors\nPremium 2, 2.5, 3 & 4.5 BHK Residences\n\nConfigurations & Carpet Area\n2 BHK \u2013 1030 & 1052 sq.ft.\n2.5 BHK \u2013 1091 to 1241 sq.ft.\n3 BHK \u2013 1213 to 1443 sq.ft.\n4.5 BHK \u2013 2189 to 2269 sq.ft.\n\n40+ Luxurious Amenities\nSwimming Pool\nGymnasium\nClubhouse\nAnd Many More\n\nPossession Status\nRERA Possession: December 2027\n\n Explore Now : https:\/\/housiey.com\/projects\/adani-atelier-greens\n\n#adaniatiergreens #adanirealty #mundhwa #mundhwapune #koregaonpark #punerealestate #punehomes #2bhk #2point5bhk #3bhk #4point5bhk #mumbaireels #housiey"},"code":"Dc6EnhHzRyf","seo_canonical_url":null,"display_uri":"https:\/\/scontent-bom2-3.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/793436535_18089553107445356_785064655966256147_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ\u00253D\u00253D&_nc_ohc=N9roGMzCv0wQ7kNvwF7d9gM&_nc_oc=AdpmnDnu-f5sefklj3RPwbRo48WMtog5TmHCB-zwe-Fve7F3aGLLQRD